   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2021-10-20.RedRocksMorrisonCO20th** (recommended): audience recording; 18 songs; 202 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Lineup listed: Bob Weir on guitar and vocals, John Mayer on guitar and vocals, Oteil Burbridge on bass and vocals [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2021-10-20.RedRocksMorrisonCO20th**: taped by W. Zimmerman; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Sennheiser Me-80 Mini Shotguns> GakCables > Mix Pre 6 @ 16/48 [1]. Also: Audience recording made with Sennheiser ME-80 mini shotgun microphones, run through GakCables into a Mix Pre 6 recorder at 16-bit/48kHz; Recorder files were tracked and edited in Sound Forge Pro 13.0, then converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper [1]",
